<title>HONG KONG: Swire's Island Plc flats oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Swire's Island Plc flats oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Properties Ltd said late on Friday that 112 units on offer at its Island Place residential development were 24 times subscribed.</p>
<p>A total of 1,321 applications had been received by the close of a two-day registration which opened on Thursday, a spokeswoman said by telephone.</p>
<p>The developer had originally offered 48 units for sale at HK$6,282 per square foot, but overwhelming response prompted the company to offer an additional 64 units at HK$6,362 per sq ft.</p>
<p>Flat selection begins on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
